    "summary": "config.write applies the write to a candidate (src/daemon/config-write.ts): a tier whose runner or model the write changed (model leaf, runner leaf, whole tier or parent object) and that names a model the user rejected and the family does not serve is refused with reason 'rejected-model' and config.json unchanged; a rejected model the definitions list again is accepted by id and alias; an accepted write reports restartRequired when tiers, tasks, coreFloor, byRepo or local.coreModel differ before and after. models.resolveRole projects the router's resolution to the sc5 wire shape (family, model, effort, inputLimit, fallback, cli kind or ollama host/numCtx/numPredict from the same factory rules); registered as a session method and in RECORDED_RPC.",
